# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:04DE"
msgid "I wonder how this pentagram is used. "
msgstr "不知道這個五芒星陣要怎麼用。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:054B"
msgid "You are standing too close to the pentagram. "
msgstr "你站得離五芒星陣太近了。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:0590"
msgid "I must be standing too close to the pentagram. "
msgstr "我一定是站得離五芒星陣太近了。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:0614"
msgid "You must place a focus at the center of the pentagram to contain the spell. "
msgstr "你必須在五芒星陣中央放一個法器來容納法術。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:068A"
msgid "Multiple foci disrupt the empowering of a spell. You may only enchant one focus at a time "
msgstr "多個法器會干擾法術的賦能。一次只能附魔一個法器"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:06F0"
msgid "I forgot to place a focus in the center of the pentagram. "
msgstr "我忘了在五芒星陣中央放法器。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:0735"
msgid "I have too many foci on the pentagram. "
msgstr "我在五芒星陣上放了太多法器。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:07F9"
msgid "Make sure you are using the proper candles and they are all lit. "
msgstr "確認你用的是正確的蠟燭，而且全都點燃了。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 007C:0858"
msgid "I must have misplaced or forgotten to light a candle. "
msgstr "我一定是放錯了，或是忘了點燃某根蠟燭。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Something's not right. "
msgctxt "bark 007C:0961"
msgid "Your candles are incorrect. "
msgstr "你的蠟燭不對。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Something's not right. "
msgctxt "bark 007C:09A0"
msgid "Perhaps the candles are set incorrectly. "
msgstr "也許蠟燭擺錯了。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Something's not right. "
msgctxt "bark 007C:0AEF"
msgid "Indeed, your reagents were incorrect for that spell. "
msgstr "確實，你用的材料不適合那道法術。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Something's not right. "
msgctxt "bark 007C:0B24"
msgid "The reagents don't seem right. "
msgstr "材料好像不對。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Something's not right. "
msgctxt "bark 007C:35E8"
msgid "The pentagram must be clear of all but sorcerous components. "
msgstr "五芒星陣上除了巫術用的材料，什麼都不能放。"

# P13 batch 4
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Something's not right. "
msgctxt "bark 007C:3654"
msgid "I can't carry all that is on the pentagram. "
msgstr "五芒星陣上的東西我拿不了那麼多。"

